flowchart TB
    subgraph MULTI[Multi-expert domain module]
        X1[Image x, hard domain k] --> E[Frozen expert E_k]
        X1 --> S1[Student feat3]
        E --> D1[D_k: expert real / student fake]
        S1 --> D1
        D1 --> LG[Student LSGAN objective: aim at real]
        E --> LD[D loss: expert real + detached student fake]
        S1 --> LD
    end
    subgraph KWAY[Single K-way domain module]
        X2[Image x] --> S2[Student feat3]
        S2 --> R[GRL: identity forward, negative feature gradient]
        R --> D2[K logits, spatial mean]
        ID[Fixed hard domain ID] --> CE[Mean cross entropy]
        D2 --> CE
    end
    S1 --> TASK1[Detection + 0.3 object Triplet]
    S2 --> TASK2[Same detection and object Triplet]
